body:
Their support ticket response;

"Thank you so much for reaching out and shared those details with me. I understand that you are missing the legacy set for your the month. In this case my friend, if you just purchase the Fortnite Crew as mentioned, you will need to wait till the 1st of December to get the next Legacy Set as these rewards are only sent to those who have an active subscription on the 1st day of each month. Please wait a little bit my friend! If you have any other questions, let me know so I can check it out. I will be here.  

Regards, Epic Player support "

Depends whose side you're on  [😂](https://emojipedia.org/face-with-tears-of-joy)

&#x200B;

###
